OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners warn Welsh island
OL,4,Acould be target for nuclear attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have warned plans for the
OL,7,FUK's first small modular reactor power
OL,8,Fstation on Anglesey could make it a
OL,9,Ftarget for attack.
OL,11,FThe anti-nuclear campaign group PAWB
OL,12,F(People Against Wylfa B) said there
OL,13,Fwould be "no safe evacuation" from the
OL,14,Fisland in an attack or nuclear
OL,15,Faccident.
OL,17,FThe group raised its concerns in an
OL,18,Fopen letter to the Secretary of State
OL,19,Ffor the Department for Energy Security
OL,20,Fand Net Zero, Miatta Fahnbulleh MP.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
