OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners warn Welsh island
OL,4,Acould be target for nuclear attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the department said
OL,7,Fthe UK adhered "to the highest
OL,8,Fstandards of safety and security at our
OL,9,Fnuclear sites", while the site
OL,10,Fdevelopers said they looked forward to
OL,11,Fdiscussing plans with residents.
